<title>USA: HEARx awards Bio-logic contract.</title>
<headline>HEARx awards Bio-logic contract.</headline>
<dateline>MUNDELEIN, Ill. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEARx Ltd said Tuesday it agreed to buy Bio-logic Systems Corp's Electrodiagnostic products for HEARx's national chain of audio-vestibular rehabilitative centers.</p>
<p>The company provides hearing care primarily to patients whose health insurance and managed care organizations have contracted with HEARx.</p>
<p>In the firslt phase, Bio-logic's Navigator systems will be placed in 18 HEARx centers. After that, up to 100 systems may be placed in additional centers within the next year.</p>
<p>The value of the agreement was not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
